===Etymology 2===
{{PIE root|en|bʰreg}}
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|refrain}}, from the {{etyl|fro|en}} verb {{m|fro|refraindre||to break off, repeat}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|re-||back, again}} + {{m|la|frangō||break}}; compare Occitan {{m|oc|refranhs||a refrain}}, {{m|oc|refranher||to repeat}}. See {{m|en|refract}} and the verb {{m|en|refrain}}.

====Noun====
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# The [[chorus]] or {{l|en|burden|id=music}} of a [[song]] [[repeat]]ed at the end of each [[verse]] or [[stanza]].
# A much repeated comment, complaint, or saying.

